# --- In programs

=== dates sorted by their time values
["2024-03-01", "2023-12-31", "2024-02-29"].map((s) => new Date(s)).toSorted((a, b) => a.getTime() - b.getTime()).map((d) => d.toISOString())
--- value
["2023-12-31T00:00:00.000Z","2024-02-29T00:00:00.000Z","2024-03-01T00:00:00.000Z"]

